\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Identification under the pinned carrying capacity. (a) The profile sum of squares over \(K\), refitting \(r\) in closed form at each \(K\): the profile is flat from about \(1500\) kt to the top of the grid, so \(K\) is not identified from above and the committed value (dotted) buys \(2.7\%\) of the criterion. (b) The functionals the results depend on are identified nevertheless: across the profile \(95\%\) set (shaded), \(g(K^*)\) and \(C^* = g(K^*) - |e_{q10}|\) vary by \(15\%\), and \(F'(K^*)\) (right axis) exceeds 1 exactly above \(2K^*\).\relax }}{19}{figure.caption.22}\protected@file@percent }
